Date: Thu, 27 Apr 2017 10:28:51 +0000
Subject: Re: [distance-sampling] Size bias regression and comparing density estimates from 5 different study sites
Message-ID: <La0zFRSDnk4.LpSNY0uaAQAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <La0zFRSDnk4.Ir6xsm4PBQAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
References: <La0zFRSDnk4.Ir6xsm4PBQAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
